{"step_index":1005,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:28:54Z","input_tokens":4104,"cache_read_tokens":120905,"output_tokens":1590,"content":"**No, they are NOT saying the same thing.** \n\nAlthough both videos use the concept of automated AI agents, they are built for **two completely different purposes**:\n\n---\n\n### Side-by-Side Comparison\n\n| Feature | **TikTok 1 (`@cotraderia`)** | **TikTok 2 (`@wavaai.feeds`)** |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Category** | 📈 **Financial Day Trading & Prop Firms** | 💡 **Startup & Business Idea Mining** |\n| **Tool Mentioned** | Claude Code / Multi-Agent Trading Desk | Grok Bot (xAI) |\n| **The Setup** | **7 Trading Agents** overseen by Claude (\"Hermes\"):<br>• **Atlas**: Macro analysis<br>• **Lumen**: Locks trading 15m around red economic news<br>• **Hydra**: Grades & vetoes bad setups<br>• **Sentinel**: Strict 0.75% risk, **2 losses = done for the day**<br>• **Hephaestus**: Builds entry, stop-loss, and target orders<br>• **Mnemosyne**: Trade journaling<br>• **Hermes (Claude)**: Final trade approval | **3 Startup Research Bots** (Scout, Analyst, Builder) running on an overnight schedule:<br>• **Scout (01:00)**: Scrapes Reddit, X, and 1-star App Store reviews for complaints (\"I wish there was\", \"I'd pay for\")<br>• **Analyst (03:00)**: Scores pains 1–25 on intensity & willingness to pay<br>• **Builder (05:00)**: Drafts a 14-day MVP plan |\n| **The Output** | Sends a trade signal to your phone to approve (Topstep 50K futures trading). | Delivers a 07:30 AM morning briefing with **3 validated software/startup ideas** with customer quotes and competitor gaps. |\n\n---\n\n### Why They Look Similar at First Glance\n1. **Multi-Agent Concept**: Both posts use an autonomous \"crew\" of AI agents handling specialized tasks sequentially.\n2. **\"Run While You Sleep\" Angle**: Both pitch the dream of letting AI do all the tedious analysis overnight.\n3. **Relation to Our Project**: \n   * **TikTok 1** is the exact logic behind our **Grok Bot Trading Dashboard** (the 2-loss auto-fire rule, strict risk limit, and trader handovers).\n   * **TikTok 2** has nothing to do with crypto or stock trading—it is an automated prompt for discovering **SaaS and business ideas** from angry customer reviews.","thinking":"The TikTok post showcases a system where seven AI agents analyze market data, risk, and news, subsequently grading trading setups. A separate AI, identified as \"Claude,\" acts as an overseer, making the final trading decision based on the aggregated assessments. The system's central concept involves automated day trading through orchestrated AI evaluation and risk management.\n\n\nThe system's phone notification indicates the final call is ready; the trading strategy integrates several AI agents, each performing a specialized function. Each agent's function needs further review to understand how they work together for successful trading.\n\nThe second TikTok presents an alternate, overnight AI system designed to uncover startup opportunities by analyzing online user complaints and pains. Its core concept involves automated market research, analyzing feedback to identify unaddressed user needs.\n\n\n"}
