{"step_index":1008,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:31:07Z","input_tokens":3725,"cache_read_tokens":123109,"output_tokens":1900,"content":"Yes, there are **5 key differences** between what we built and what is shown in TikTok 1:\n\n---\n\n### Side-by-Side Comparison: Our Dashboard vs. TikTok 1\n\n| Feature | **TikTok 1 (`@cotraderia`)** | **Our Grok Bot Dashboard** |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **1. The Market / Asset** | **US Futures & Prop Firms** (Topstep \\$50K account trading CME equity futures like NQ / ES / Gold). | **Crypto Spot & Perps** (SOL, BTC, ETH) modeled after the original \\$42 $\\to$ \\$5,739 TikTok video. |\n| **2. Agent Architecture** | **7 Specialized Team Roles** working as a single committee:<br>• `Atlas` (Macro trends)<br>• `Lumen` (News freeze)<br>• `Hydra` (Setup grader)<br>• `Sentinel` (0.75% risk manager)<br>• `Hephaestus` (Order builder)<br>• `Mnemosyne` (Trade journaler)<br>• `Hermes` (Claude review) | **Trader Bench & Regime Engine**:<br>• 6 distinct algorithmic traders (`0xAlpha`, `0xWhale`, `0xDelta`, etc.)<br>• Real-time **Order Book Imbalance (OBI)** and Volatility Regime classifier (`CALM`, `TRENDING`, `JITTERY`, `CRASH`). |\n| **3. How Trades Get Executed** | **Human-in-the-Loop (\"Semi-Automated\")**:<br>The AI does all the scanning, grading, and math, then sends a push notification to the user’s phone with an **\"Approve\"** button. The human clicks yes or no. | **Fully Automated Reactive Simulation**:<br>The engine compounds automatically in the browser with live speed controls (1x to 10x), streaming trades continuously. |\n| **4. Trade Frequency** | **Ultra-Selective (~2 trades a day)**:<br>Stands aside and takes zero trades on volatile or uncertain days. Only takes high-grade A+ setups. | **High-Frequency Visual Flow**:<br>Executes rapid trades every few seconds so you can watch the stepped equity curve and trader handover rules live. |\n| **5. Macro & News Protection** | **Economic Calendar Filter (`Lumen`)**:<br>Freezes trading 15 minutes before and after high-impact red economic news events (US CPI, FOMC Interest Rates, Non-Farm Payrolls). | **Microstructure Volatility Filter**:<br>Monitors bid-ask spread width, order book depth, and our **15% high-water mark drawdown handbrake**. |\n\n---\n\n### What They Have in Common (The Identical Core Rule)\n* **The \"Two Strikes and You're Out\" Handbrake**:\n  * In TikTok 1: `Sentinel` enforces *\"2 losses = done for the day. No negotiation.\"*\n  * In our dashboard: The 4th card tracks `Consecutive Losses: 0/2`. When a trader hits 2 losses, the referee fires them and switches to the next trader on the bench.\n* **Capital Protection over Greed**: Both systems are designed to eliminate revenge trading, FOMO, and over-trading by letting mathematical rules control risk.\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n* **TikTok 1** is a **semi-automated futures signal desk** running behind the scenes to help someone pass a Topstep prop firm challenge.\n* **Our Project** is an **interactive visual terminal and simulation engine** designed to showcase real-time copy trading, trader auto-firing, order book imbalances, and dynamic regime switching.","thinking":"TikTok 1 employs a multi-agent AI system for trading, where individual agents analyze market data and news. A central AI then synthesizes the analyses from these agents to generate a unified trading decision, which is then delivered to the user. This structured, multi-layered approach contrasts with a single-agent or human-driven model.\n\n\nThis system employs a multi-agent structure; individual agents handle distinct functions like macro analysis, news event management, setup evaluation, and risk control. The system's rules rigidly enforce risk parameters and trade acceptance, limiting emotional influence.\n\nThe TikTok's system's consistent profitability stems from this structured, disciplined, and rule-based approach. The absence of discretionary elements creates predictable trading behavior. I must consider how to apply such a structured rule set to my own dashboard and system.\n\n\n"}
